  => STEP 6 PASS: 9 of 10 for a group that did not exist before the reboot -- one frame
     to the tree build -- and 0 of 10 for the never-joined control 239.33.33.33 in the
     same leg. The VRFs, their loopbacks, their interface memberships, their addresses,
     per-VRF multicast routing, PIM and the per-VRF RPs all survived, AND the dataplane
     works after the reboot, which is the half a config read cannot prove.

STEP 7 -- removal, per VRF and per feature                                         PASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
awplus(config)#no ip multicast-routing vrf red
awplus#show running-config | include multicast
no ip multicast-routing
