cap v8-removed-eth4.pcap: 10 frame(s)
  x10 ICMP t8/c0 10.38.22.40 -> 10.38.22.65 [ours]   <-- unicast in RED still 10/10

  => STEP 7 PASS: 0 of 10 for group 239.32.32.32, which had been forwarding 9 of 10 a
     minute earlier with a live membership, WHILE unicast routing inside the same VRF
     kept working at 10 of 10. The removal is proven in running-config and in the
     dataplane, and it is surgical in both dimensions at once: only multicast, and only
     in red.
